4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME A PROP (LITERALLY)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too scared? Turn into a <strong>cube</strong>. Enemies might ignore you.<br>Teammates might <strong>step</strong> <strong>on</strong> you. Or <strong>drag</strong> you.<br>Blend in. Or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291090/extras/8c95b1908755f7970e5b045ff77cb7fd.poster.avif?t=1762833523\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291090/extras/8c95b1908755f7970e5b045ff77cb7fd.webm?t=1762833523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291090/extras/8c95b1908755f7970e5b045ff77cb7fd.mp4?t=1762833523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON\u2019T BECOME PREY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsters</strong> roam the dungeons. Some hunt by sound.<br>Some stalk. Some rush. All are hungry.<br>Keep Corp. property (you) safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291090/extras/075304be86adc060c928a826fd6ca0df.poster.avif?t=1762833523\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291090/extras/075304be86adc060c928a826fd6ca0df.webm?t=1762833523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291090/extras/075304be86adc060c928a826fd6ca0df.mp4?t=1762833523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EQUIP YOURSELF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy gear on the ship: jump-pads, medkits, crea